\b0 \fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 Returns the time that the lock occurred. \
\fs14\
\fs28 This method is potentially useful to applications that want to use an age heuristic to decide if a lock is too old and should be broken. Returns \b nil\b0  if the lock doesn\'27t exist. \
\fs14\
